'''Walt Disney Records''', is a [[Wikipedia:Record label|record label]] that publishes soundtracks. Following the [[The Walt Disney Company]]'s acquisition of [[Lucasfilm]] in [[2012]] Walt Disney Records began publishing soundtracks to ''[[Star Wars]]'' media, starting with the [[Star Wars: The Force Awakens (soundtrack)|soundtrack]] to the [[2015]] film [[Star Wars: Episode VII The Force Awakens|''Star Wars'': Episode VII ''The Force Awakens'']].<ref name="The Force Awakens">[[Star Wars: The Force Awakens (soundtrack)|''The Force Awakens'' soundtrack]]</ref>

